  "keyPoints": {
    "en": [
      "The Aircraft Tree has two primary paths: speed-focused (F-22A, Su-57) and payload-focused (B-2A, F-117A). Choose one path and invest MRP exclusively in that tree until completion; hybrid investment delays both paths by 3–4 campaigns.",
      "MSSL (standard missiles) have limited capacity per sortie—fire exclusively at aircraft or ground vehicles in your visual cone, never fire-and-forget at targets outside 1.5km. Wasted missiles create no-lock-on phases that cost mission time.",
      "Enemy aces (marked with unique callsigns) appear only in specific mission time windows—completing mission objectives within the first 70% of the time limit triggers ace spawns in most missions. Aces drop unique aircraft skin parts.",
      "Cloud layers in AC7 physically impair missile lock-on within 800m—use the cloud mechanic offensively to reset enemy lock-on by flying through clouds when targeted by multiple enemies simultaneously.",
      "Multiplayer ranking (Battle Royal and Team Deathmatch) is separated from campaign—aircraft unlocked in campaign carry over to multiplayer, but multiplayer-exclusive cosmetics require ranked match participation."
    ],
    "ja": [
      "機体ツリーには2つの主要なパスがある：スピード重視（F-22A、Su-57）とペイロード重視（B-2A、F-117A）。1つのパスを選んでMRPを完了まで専用に投資する。ハイブリッド投資は両方のパスを3〜4キャンペーン遅らせる。",
      "MSSL（標準ミサイル）はソーティーごとの容量が限られている。視覚コーン内の航空機または地上車両にのみ発射し、1.5km外のターゲットに対して撃ちっぱなしにしない。無駄なミサイルはミッション時間を犠牲にするノーロックオンフェーズを生む。",
      "敵エース（固有のコールサインで識別）は特定のミッション時間ウィンドウにのみ現れる。ほとんどのミッションで時間制限の最初の70%以内にミッション目標を完了するとエーススポーンがトリガーされる。エースはユニークな機体スキンパーツをドロップする。",
      "AC7の雲層は800m以内のミサイルロックオンを物理的に妨害する。複数の敵に同時に狙われた時、雲を飛行して敵のロックオンをリセットするために雲のメカニックを攻撃的に使用する。",
      "マルチプレイヤーランキング（バトルロイヤルとチームデスマッチ）はキャンペーンとは別。キャンペーンでロック解除された機体はマルチプレイヤーに引き継がれるが、マルチプレイヤー専用のコスメティックはランクマッチ参加が必要。"
    ]
  },
  "opening": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "First Aircraft Unlock Priority",
        "body": "Start the aircraft tree investment with the F/A-18F Super Hornet (requires 52,000 MRP from base F/A-18F) as the earliest high-performance multi-role platform. It provides the best missile capacity to speed ratio before the fourth-generation aircraft become available. Alternatively, invest in the MiG-21bis path for its lower MRP requirement and balanced speed/agility for early campaign dogfights. Both paths converge at the F-16C Fighting Falcon at mid-game, which is the recommended bridge aircraft before choosing a specialisation."
      },
      {
        "title": "Mission 1–5 Weapon Selection",
        "body": "Early missions favour MSSL and SASM (Surface-to-Air Short Range Missiles) over specialised weapons. Do not unlock LACM (Long-range cruise missiles) until mission 7—early missions require close-range engagement for S-rank kill counts that LACM cannot efficiently achieve. XMA (Exhaust-guided missiles that track heat signatures) becomes available after mission 5 and is the best general-purpose air-to-air weapon for the next 6 missions; always equip it when available against ace-class targets."
      }
    ]
  },
  "midGame": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "S-Rank Mission Strategy",
        "body": "S-rank in most AC7 missions requires killing 150% of the kill count target within the mission timer. The universal S-rank method: destroy all time-bonus UAV formations (marked with blue outlines) in the first 3 minutes, then immediately switch to ground target destruction before tackling ace enemies. Ground targets provide consistent kill count increments with less combat time per kill than air-to-air; building count on ground first avoids time pressure during ace hunting phases."
      },
      {
        "title": "Clouds and Weather System Use",
        "body": "Mission 8 (Stonehenge) introduces the first cloud layer combat environment. The cloud system in AC7 rewards pilots who understand its lock-on break mechanic: fly into a cloud when three or more enemies have simultaneous missile lock-on—clouds break all lock-ons within 2 seconds. Exit the cloud at full speed on a different heading to extend the lock-free flight time. This technique is also valid in multiplayer, where it counters the primary missile spam strategy."
      }
    ]
  },
  "endGame": {
    "en": [
      {
        "title": "DLC Missions and Aircraft",
        "body": "The three DLC mission sets (Unexpected Visitor, Anchorhead Raid, Ten Million Relief Plan) each introduce unique aircraft from previous Ace Combat games. DLC aircraft (ADF-11F Raven, ADF-01 FALKEN, ADFX-01 Morgan) are priced at 1.8–2.2 million MRP—prioritise one DLC aircraft based on your playstyle (FALKEN for fast attack, Morgan for payload, Raven for balanced). Completing all 3 DLC missions on Hard difficulty provides enough MRP to unlock a second DLC aircraft."
      }
    ]
  },
  "mistakes": {
    "en": [
      "Wasting special weapons on standard enemy fighters in early missions—special weapons are limited per sortie; reserve PLSL (pulse laser) and LASM (large air-to-ship missiles) for high-HP targets like gunships and frigates.",
      "Ignoring aircraft part combination bonuses—equipping 3 parts from the same family provides a set bonus not listed individually; check the set bonus description in the Parts menu before finalising part loadouts.",
      "Flying in straight lines while under missile lock—AC7 missiles track by predictive lead targeting; breaking into a hard 90° turn when a missile is within 600m consistently outperforms barrel rolls and loops.",
      "Not completing ace encounter requirements before the timer limit—aces spawn only within a specific time window; completing objectives too slowly means the ace never appears and the unique skin reward is missed.",
      "Selling excess aircraft parts before completing the collection achievement—certain parts are only available from specific enemy types in specific missions; keep all parts until the full collection achievement is within reach."
    ],
    "ja": [
      "序盤のミッションで標準的な敵戦闘機に特殊武器を無駄にする。特殊武器はソーティーごとに限られている。PLSL（パルスレーザー）とLASM（大型対艦ミサイル）はガンシップやフリゲート艦などの高HPターゲット専用に残す。",
      "機体パーツのコンビネーションボーナスを無視する。同じファミリーの3つのパーツを装備すると個別にはリストされないセットボーナスが提供される。パーツのロードアウトを確定する前にパーツメニューのセットボーナスの説明を確認する。",
      "ミサイルロック中に直線飛行する。AC7のミサイルは予測リードターゲティングで追跡する。ミサイルが600m以内にある時、急な90°のターンに入ることがバレルロールやループより一貫して優れている。",
      "タイマー制限前にエースエンカウントの要件を完了しない。エースは特定の時間ウィンドウ内にのみスポーンする。目標を完了するのが遅すぎるとエースは出現せず、ユニークなスキン報酬を逃す。",
      "コレクション実績を完了する前に余分な機体パーツを売る。特定のパーツは特定のミッションの特定の敵タイプからのみ入手可能。完全なコレクション実績に手が届くまで全パーツを保管する。"
    ]
